Third-party portions
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of the custom window title bar and client-side window decorations
were adapted from Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), specifically
the `workspace`, `platform_title_bar`, and `theme` crates, which are licensed
under GPL-3.0-or-later. Copyright (C) Zed Industries, Inc.

Affected files:
  - crates/ui/src/decorations.rs
  - crates/ui/src/components/title_bar.rs

The text input module (crates/ui/src/components/input/) is derived from the
gpui text-input example (crates/gpui/examples/input.rs) and the Tokio bridge
(crates/thrustr/src/tokio.rs) from gpui_tokio, both Copyright (C) Zed
Industries, Inc. and licensed under Apache-2.0.

Thrustr also depends on gpui, gpui_macros, and gpui_platform from the same
project, which are licensed under Apache-2.0.
